          "title": "You'll want to know: le bricolage",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le bricolage — \"DIY, odd jobs\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Le week-end, mon oncle fait du bricolage. At the weekend my uncle does DIY."
            },
